---
/**
 * Página de Política de Privacidade (Privacy Policy).
 */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy and data practices for Paw & Home Guides."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 prose text-slate-800">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <h2>Introduction</h2>
    <p>
      At Paw & Home Guides, accessible from our website, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document outlines what information we collect and how we utilize it.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
    <p>
      We use standard cookies to analyze traffic patterns and maintain affiliate tracking. When you follow an affiliate link to Amazon.com, Amazon may set a temporary tracking cookie in your browser to attribute qualifying purchases in accordance with their privacy policy.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p>
      Our website contains outbound links to external third-party retailers including Amazon.com. We do not control their privacy practices or content. We strongly recommend reviewing the privacy policies of any site you visit.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this policy, please reach out via our editorial contact channels.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
